Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather round, come take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Theatre of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.67,0:00:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Collapse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a story about a dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.03,0:00:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.27,0:00:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The dam will burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The dam will burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away! run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,On such a sunny day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the dam won't burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hirahara
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,i used to be in charge of building a dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a fine man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother at the dam construction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look in front of me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm not talking about losing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The dam will burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The dam will burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.81,0:00:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The dam will burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,83 cases occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.17,0:00:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,83 cases occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,he was discharged immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,83 Respond to cases as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you checking the 83 area?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.66,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah but,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,83 is a no-go zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This time it's a special case.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the allowance is bouncy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I’ve heard the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You need the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.01,0:01:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s a cute girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.81,0:01:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the one from that snack bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That cunning old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the divergence zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There seems to be no particular problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A statue of a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.25,0:01:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this statue...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it's damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How is there no water leaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there an anomaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,From the damaged part
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to get closer to the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah, i'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.57,0:02:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Repairs in Sector 83 complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Repair complete
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.89,0:02:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hirahara hasn't left yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The dam will burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Hirahara's young brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Reached the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.85,0:03:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't repair it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The boundary between here and there will dissolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
